{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"better\":\"Y\",\"regress\":\"有，Y对音乐细节和情绪转折的描写明显少于X，尤其缺少X中随乐句变化逐步出现的细微听觉线索。\",\"nets\":{\"scan\":\"Y\",\"point\":\"Y\",\"why\":\"Y\",\"whole\":\"Y\",\"fine\":\"X\"},\"why\":\"Y的左右分栏让叙事和感受各有位置，句子连贯，人物每一步为什么靠近、犹豫、退缩和重新放松都比较容易理解，整体故事也更容易跟下来。X的重点加亮和音乐时间对应做得更细，但感受词数量过多、意象有时相互堆叠，听音乐时容易顾不过来。细腻度上X更胜一筹，音乐变化和情绪层次更丰富；但作为普通观众边听边扫的整体体验，我选Y。</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "080db900-64ad-43c5-8f11-9498f3e627b6", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T022159454374Z", "elapsed_seconds": 27.579, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T02:22:27.046176+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "e2d978db2ddb36cf539e551d739678ec314c4ad87a280b3298425f54f1b3b876", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screensho